				<!-- Main -->
					<div id="main">

						<!-- Introduction -->
							<section id="intro" class="main">
								<div class="spotlight">
									<div class="content main">
										<header class="major">
											<h2>What stories does your data have to tell?</h2>
										</header>
										<p>
                      <!-- TODO: FIX LAYOUT
                        <span class="image sketch left"><img src="images/sketch.jpg" alt="" width="70%;"/></span>-->
                      Data&mdash;big or small&mdash;has stories to tell if you know how to find them. The most memorable and impactful stories are told through relevant insights blended with clear and meaningful visualizations. Understanding and unlocking the ability to use data enables your business to better meet today's needs while fueling growth for tomorrow.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <span class="brandCallout">Magick</span> partners with you to leverage (and profit from) the data assets, software tools, and business processes your company already uses.</p>

									</div>
									<span class="showcase right"><img src="assets/images/sketchbook.png" alt="" /></span>
								</div>
							</section>

						<!-- Services: Intro -->
              <section id="services" class="main" >
                <div class="content">
                  <header class="major content">
                    <h2>How We Help</h2>
                  </header>
                  <p>
                    Our technomancers have been called to stand against the Dark Forces of drugerous business processes, unfriendly and outdated product interfaces, and the legions of manual and repetitive data-entry tasks. We've learned from these sub-optimal experiences and discovered there are far better ways to use the Power of Technology in magickal ways to work smarter, not harder.
                  </p>

                  <p>
                    <span class="brandCallout">Magick</span> has a spell book full of problem-solving methods, awareness of best practices to use (and those to avoid), and the technical know-how to conjure custom solutions for the challenges facing your business.
                  </p>

                </div>


                <ul class="serviceCards">
                  <li class="ideation">
                    <img src="assets/images/ideation_strategy_card.png" />
                  </li>
                  <li class="datasciences">
                    <img src="assets/images/data_sciences_card.png" />
                  </li>
                  <li class="infoarts">
                    <img src="assets/images/information_arts_card.png" />
                  </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- Services: Areas (with SubNav)-->
                <div class="row">

                  <!-- Services: Content -->
                  <div id="serviceContent" class="col-12">

                    <!-- @include assets/page_templates/service-strategy.kit -->
